description: Always replace old Windows player build; do not keep multiple builds
alwaysApply: true
---

# Windows Builds

- Keep a single Windows player under `Builds/Windows/`.
- Before each new build: delete the existing `Builds/Windows` output (folder contents / previous exe + `_Data`), then build into the same path.
- Do not create dated folders, `Build2`, `Windows_old`, or parallel player copies unless the user explicitly asks.
- Prefer the existing menu / batch entry: `Catapulto/Build Windows x64` → `Builds/Windows/CatapultoFPS.exe`.
